[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/task_queue/tests/task_worker_impl_test.py: Resolve the TaskWorker implementation through a shadow-safe namespace loader instead of the package-qualified task_queue.lib path that the harness shadows with the top-level task_queue/task_worker specification modules. The loader reuses the exposed implementation module and derives the TaskQueue collaborator interface plus WorkerExecutionException from that module, so mocks, singleton keys, and exception identity match the implementation at runtime. Contract coverage unchanged: execute payload transformation and completion reporting, failing-task and unavailable-queue WorkerExecutionException branches, fetch_and_execute dispatch wiring, and processed_count/last_task_id/is_busy/reset telemetry.
